---@field note string What happens on the machine, in one sentence.
---@field warnings boxd.StringList What the change won't do: e.g. a removed package isn't undone.
---@field skipped boxd.StringList `packages`: commands the change skips (removed from the spec before they finished: they never run, and stop nothing) and commands it puts back to pending (skipped, and listed again).
---@field unskipped boxd.StringList

