---@field changes boxd.MachineSpecChangeList What the patch changes, field by field in the spec's order. Empty when it changes nothing, except that `retry_packages` always shows as a change of "packages" (whose note says when there is nothing to retry).
---@field rebootRequired boolean A change applies only through a reboot (see `reboot` on the request).
---@field rebootRecommended boolean A change reaches running processes only once they restart.
---@field spec? boxd.MachineSpec The machine's spec after the patch (for a dry run, what it would be).
---@field applied boolean False for a dry run.
---@field rebooted boolean The machine was rebooted to apply the patch.
---@field resizeError string The resize failed after the rest of the patch applied: its error. Then `applied` is true, `rebooted` false, and `spec` is the spec stored now, with the size the machine has. Empty otherwise.

